As proof of your right to the throne,

262
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:49,540
please preserve my father's dream
and maintain peace in Egypt.

263
00:18:49,900 --> 00:18:50,940
Yes, my king.

264
00:18:51,660 --> 00:18:53,700
It is you who is now king.

265
00:19:00,840 --> 00:19:04,740
Are you sure about this? I am. Nice!

266
00:19:05,040 --> 00:19:06,746
Then let's hit the high road.

267
00:19:06,900 --> 00:19:08,200
Back to the future.

268
00:19:08,500 --> 00:19:09,680
Or the present.

269
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:10,880
Or whatever.

270
00:19:16,500 --> 00:19:18,217
Have a safe journey!

271
00:19:18,300 --> 00:19:19,560
I'll miss you!

272
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:22,560
And thank you for everything!

273
00:19:23,660 --> 00:19:25,220
Farewell, my Pharaoh.
